<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<h3>Product Information &amp; Community Projects</h3>
<article>
<h4>What is FalkorDB and what are its primary use cases?</h4>
<p>FalkorDB is a high-performance graph database designed for managing comp=
lex relationships and enabling advanced AI applications. Its primary use ca=
ses include Text2SQL (natural language to SQL queries), Security Graphs for=
 CNAPP/CSPM/CIEM, GraphRAG for advanced retrieval, Agentic AI &amp; Chatbot=
s, Fraud Detection, and high-performance graph storage for complex relation=
ships. <a href=3D"https://www.falkordb.com/">Learn more</a>.</p>

</article>
<article>
<h4>What are FalkorDB community projects?</h4>
<p>FalkorDB community projects showcase applications and tools built by use=
rs and contributors, including GraphRAG workflows, knowledge graph visualiz=
ations, and integrations with LLMs. These projects demonstrate real-world u=
se cases and innovative solutions using FalkorDB. <a href=3D"https://www.fa=
lkordb.com/community-projects/">Explore community projects</a>.</p>

</article>
<article>
<h4>How can I get started with FalkorDB?</h4>
<p>You can get started by signing up for FalkorDB Cloud, launching a free i=
nstance, or running FalkorDB locally using Docker. Comprehensive documentat=
ion and tutorials are available to guide you through setup and advanced con=
figurations. <a href=3D"https://app.falkordb.cloud/?__hstc=3D192023605.b96e=
c7194926884cf5e2dc7b49268c23.1792052065141.1792052065141.1792098636055.2&am=
p;__hssc=3D192023605.3.1792098636055&amp;__hsfp=3D06f0d7ded21820fe75114cee0=
4ef2980">Get Started Free</a> | <a href=3D"https://docs.falkordb.com/">View=
 Documentation</a>.</p>

</article>
<article>
<h4>What documentation and resources are available for FalkorDB?</h4>
<p>FalkorDB offers complete guides, API references, and technical documenta=
tion at <a href=3D"https://docs.falkordb.com/">docs.falkordb.com</a>. You c=
an also access release notes on the <a href=3D"https://github.com/FalkorDB/=
FalkorDB/releases">GitHub Releases Page</a> and join community discussions =
on Discord and GitHub.</p>

</article>
<article>
<h4>What are some popular community use cases for FalkorDB?</h4>
<p>Popular community use cases include building GraphRAG-powered AI assista=
nts for BFSI, mental health QA chatbots, movie recommendation systems, and =
visualizing code graphs for open-source projects. These projects highlight =
FalkorDB's versatility in knowledge graph and retrieval-augmented generatio=
n workflows.</p>

</article>
<article>
<h4>How can I join the FalkorDB community or get support?</h4>
<p>You can join the FalkorDB community by participating in GitHub discussio=
ns, chatting on Discord, or emailing the support team. Community support is=
 available for troubleshooting, sharing ideas, and collaborating on project=
